{"seq":3,"slug":"ml-derivatives-pricing","title":"机器学习在衍生品定价中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/advanced/ml-derivatives-pricing","wordCount":2645,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"机器学习在衍生品定价中的应用\">机器学习在衍生品定价中的应用</h1><p>传统衍生品定价依赖于假设驱动的数学模型（BSM、Heston、LMM 等），而机器学习（ML）方法通过数据驱动的方式学习定价函数，能够捕捉传统模型难以表达的市场非线性特征。2025-2026 年的研究表明，ML 方法在特定场景下已经超越传统模型的精度，同时在计算效率和实时对冲方面展现出巨大优势。本文梳理 ML 在衍生品定价中的主要应用方向、技术方法和前沿进展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>机器学习在衍生品定价中的核心概念和应用范式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>函数逼近范式</strong>：将定价视为从参数空间到价格的映射学习——NN 训练后推理速度比 MC 快 3-5 个数量级</li>\n<li><strong>PINN（Physics-Informed NN）</strong>：将 BS PDE 嵌入损失函数——无需训练标签、保证物理一致性、一次训练得全域解</li>\n<li><strong>深度对冲（Deep Hedging）</strong>：直接学习交易成本感知的最优对冲策略——超越 BSM Delta 的理想化假设</li>\n<li><strong>校准加速</strong>：用逆映射 NN 将模型校准从分钟级压缩到毫秒级——使实时重新校准成为可能</li>\n<li><strong>混合方法（model + ML）</strong>：传统模型提供骨架和可解释性，ML 提供修正和加速——2026 年的主流范式</li>\n<li><strong>不确定性量化</strong>：锚定集成等方法在给出点估计的同时提供预测不确定性带——生产部署的必要条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ml-在衍生品定价中的应用图景\">ML 在衍生品定价中的应用图景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[ML 在衍生品定价中的应用] --&gt; B[定价函数逼近]&#10;    A --&gt; C[波动率曲面建模]&#10;    A --&gt; D[对冲策略优化]&#10;    A --&gt; E[模型校准加速]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[神经网络替代 MC/PDE]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Physics-Informed NN]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Gaussian Process]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[隐含波动率预测]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[曲面插值/外推]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[动态因子模型]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[深度对冲 Deep Hedging]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[强化学习对冲]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[最优执行]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[校准逆问题]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[参数快速搜索]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[实时重新校准]\">flowchart TD\n    A[ML 在衍生品定价中的应用] --&gt; B[定价函数逼近]\n    A --&gt; C[波动率曲面建模]\n    A --&gt; D[对冲策略优化]\n    A --&gt; E[模型校准加速]\n    B --&gt; B1[神经网络替代 MC/PDE]\n    B --&gt; B2[Physics-Informed NN]\n    B --&gt; B3[Gaussian Process]\n    C --&gt; C1[隐含波动率预测]\n    C --&gt; C2[曲面插值/外推]\n    C --&gt; C3[动态因子模型]\n    D --&gt; D1[深度对冲 Deep Hedging]\n    D --&gt; D2[强化学习对冲]\n    D --&gt; D3[最优执行]\n    E --&gt; E1[校准逆问题]\n    E --&gt; E2[参数快速搜索]\n    E --&gt; E3[实时重新校准]</pre><h2 id=\"神经网络作为定价函数逼近器\">神经网络作为定价函数逼近器</h2><h3 id=\"基本思路\">基本思路</h3><p>训练神经网络学习从市场参数到期权价格的映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>↦</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta: (S, K, T, r, \\sigma, ...) \\mapsto V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一旦训练完成，推理速度比 MC 或 PDE 快 3-5 个数量级，使得实时风险计算和大规模组合定价成为可能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"训练数据生成\">训练数据生成</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型生成（BSM/Heston MC）</td>\n<td>无限量、无噪声、标签精确</td>\n<td>依赖模型假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场真实数据</td>\n<td>反映真实市场特征</td>\n<td>有限量、含噪声、存在错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合方式</td>\n<td>兼顾量与质</td>\n<td>需要精心设计混合策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"网络架构选择\">网络架构选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前馈网络 (FFN)</td>\n<td>欧式期权定价</td>\n<td>简单、快速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>残差网络 (ResNet)</td>\n<td>高维定价</td>\n<td>深层训练稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力机制</td>\n<td>序列输入（期限结构）</td>\n<td>捕捉长程依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图神经网络 (GNN)</td>\n<td>投资组合/网络结构</td>\n<td>关系建模</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实验结果\">实验结果</h3><p>2025 年 Arxiv 研究（Kazemian et al.）对比了多种方法在欧式期权定价上的表现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>MAE</th>\n<th>RMSE</th>\n<th>推理时间（ms）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Black-Scholes 公式</td>\n<td>0 (基准)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准蒙特卡洛 (10⁶ paths)</td>\n<td>0.02</td>\n<td>0.03</td>\n<td>500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前馈神经网络</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>0.07</td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PINN (Physics-Informed)</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>0.07</td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CatBoost / Random Forest</td>\n<td>0.08</td>\n<td>0.12</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于 Heston 模型下的定价（无解析公式的复杂场景），ML 方法的优势更为明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"physics-informed-neural-networks-pinn\">Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINN)</h2><h3 id=\"核心创新\">核心创新</h3><p>PINN 将物理约束（如 BS PDE）直接嵌入神经网络的损失函数，使得网络不仅拟合数据，还满足定价方程的微分约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>PDE</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>BC</mtext></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>BC</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>IC</mtext></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>IC</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{total}} = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{PDE}} + \\lambda_{\\text{BC}} \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{BC}} + \\lambda_{\\text{IC}} \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{IC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PDE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>PDE</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{PDE}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PDE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：BS PDE 残差在内部点的均方误差</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>BC</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{BC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：边界条件的违反程度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>IC</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{IC}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IC</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：终端条件（到期收益）的拟合误差</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"优势\">优势</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>无需标记数据</strong>：只需 PDE 和边界条件，不需要预先用 MC 生成训练标签</li>\n<li><strong>物理一致性</strong>：输出保证满足定价方程（在训练精度内）</li>\n<li><strong>全域解</strong>：一次训练得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全域的定价函数</li>\n<li><strong>Greeks 自动获得</strong>：通过自动微分直接计算所有偏导数</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2025-2026-最新进展\">2025-2026 最新进展</h3><p><strong>不确定性量化</strong>：Kazemian et al.（2025）提出 AT-PINN（Anchored Transfer PINN），通过锚定集成（anchored ensembling）在提供点估计的同时给出预测不确定性带（uncertainty band）。在欧式和美式期权上达到 explained variance ≈ 0.999。</p>\n<p><strong>美式期权处理</strong>：通过障碍型松弛（obstacle-style relaxation）在连续域内处理早行权约束，避免了传统时间步进方法的误差累积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度对冲-deep-hedging\">深度对冲（Deep Hedging）</h2><h3 id=\"传统对冲的局限\">传统对冲的局限</h3><p>BSM Delta 对冲假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易成本为零</li>\n<li>可以连续调仓</li>\n<li>波动率为常数</li>\n<li>市场完备</li>\n</ul>\n<p>现实中这些假设都不成立，导致 BSM 对冲策略次优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"deep-hedging-框架\">Deep Hedging 框架</h3><p>Buehler et al.（2019）提出的 Deep Hedging 直接学习最优对冲策略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>TC</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_\\theta \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\rho\\left(-V_T + \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} \\delta_\\theta(S_i, t_i, ...) \\cdot (S_{i+1} - S_i) - \\text{TC}(\\delta_{i+1} - \\delta_i)\\right)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是神经网络参数化的对冲策略，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是风险度量（如 CVaR），TC 为交易成本函数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>BSM Delta 对冲</th>\n<th>Deep Hedging</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易成本</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n<td>直接纳入优化目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场摩擦</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n<td>流动性、滑点可建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型假设</td>\n<td>GBM</td>\n<td>可学习真实市场动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险度量</td>\n<td>方差最小化</td>\n<td>任意凸风险度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算效率</td>\n<td>实时（公式）</td>\n<td>训练后实时（推理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>高（Delta = N(d₁)）</td>\n<td>低（黑盒）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"强化学习在对冲中的应用\">强化学习在对冲中的应用</h3><p>将对冲问题建模为马尔可夫决策过程（MDP）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>portfolio composition</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>market features</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S_t, t, \\text{portfolio composition}, \\text{market features})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">portfolio composition</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">market features</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>动作</strong>：调整对冲比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>奖励</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>PnL variance</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>transaction costs</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-|\\text{PnL variance}| - \\lambda \\cdot |\\text{transaction costs}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PnL variance</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transaction costs</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>PPO、SAC 等算法可以学习在市场摩擦下的最优对冲策略，无需指定参数化的价格模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"波动率曲面的-ml-建模\">波动率曲面的 ML 建模</h2><h3 id=\"隐含波动率曲面预测\">隐含波动率曲面预测</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变分自编码器 (VAE)</td>\n<td>当前曲面 + 市场数据</td>\n<td>未来曲面分布</td>\n<td>生成式建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件 GAN</td>\n<td>市场状态</td>\n<td>完整曲面</td>\n<td>高保真度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>历史曲面序列</td>\n<td>下一时刻曲面</td>\n<td>捕捉长程依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子分析 + NN</td>\n<td>PCA 因子</td>\n<td>重建曲面</td>\n<td>可解释 + 灵活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"无套利约束的-ml-曲面\">无套利约束的 ML 曲面</h3><p>确保 ML 生成的波动率曲面满足无套利条件是一个重要的技术挑战：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>静态无套利</strong>：无蝶式套利（凸性）、无日历套利（单调性）</li>\n<li><strong>动态无套利</strong>：曲面演化满足 HJM 漂移条件</li>\n</ol>\n<p>方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬约束</strong>：在网络输出层强制满足凸性（如 softplus 变换保证正密度）</li>\n<li><strong>软约束</strong>：将违反程度加入损失函数作为正则项</li>\n<li><strong>架构设计</strong>：使用保证凸性的网络架构（如 Input Convex Neural Networks, ICNN）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模型校准的-ml-加速\">模型校准的 ML 加速</h2><h3 id=\"传统校准的痛点\">传统校准的痛点</h3><p>将 Heston/SLV 等复杂模型校准到市场需要反复调用定价引擎，是计算密集型任务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>market</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_\\theta \\sum_{i} \\left(V_{\\text{model}}(K_i, T_i; \\theta) - V_{\\text{market}}(K_i, T_i)\\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每次迭代可能需要数百次 MC 模拟或 PDE 求解。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ml-加速方案\">ML 加速方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[校准加速方案] --&gt; B[替代模型 Surrogate]&#10;    A --&gt; C[逆映射学习]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Bayesian 优化]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[训练 NN 近似 V_model theta]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[用 NN 替代 MC 在优化循环中]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[直接学习 市场价格 → 参数]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[一次前向传播完成校准]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[智能搜索参数空间]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[减少定价引擎调用次数]\">flowchart TD\n    A[校准加速方案] --&gt; B[替代模型 Surrogate]\n    A --&gt; C[逆映射学习]\n    A --&gt; D[Bayesian 优化]\n    B --&gt; B1[训练 NN 近似 V_model theta]\n    B --&gt; B2[用 NN 替代 MC 在优化循环中]\n    C --&gt; C1[直接学习 市场价格 → 参数]\n    C --&gt; C2[一次前向传播完成校准]\n    D --&gt; D1[智能搜索参数空间]\n    D --&gt; D2[减少定价引擎调用次数]</pre><p><strong>逆映射学习</strong>的优势在于：训练完成后，校准只需一次神经网络前向传播（毫秒级），使得实时重新校准成为可能——这对做市商在盘中持续更新模型参数至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践中的挑战与注意事项\">实践中的挑战与注意事项</h2><h3 id=\"模型风险与可解释性\">模型风险与可解释性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>缓解方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黑盒风险</td>\n<td>ML 模型缺乏解释性</td>\n<td>SHAP 值、注意力可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外推风险</td>\n<td>训练域外预测不可靠</td>\n<td>集成不确定性、域检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据偏差</td>\n<td>历史数据不代表未来</td>\n<td>对抗训练、分布移位检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过拟合</td>\n<td>学习噪声而非模式</td>\n<td>交叉验证、正则化、早停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无套利违反</td>\n<td>输出可能违反无套利条件</td>\n<td>硬约束、PINN、后处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"混合方法-模型-ml\">混合方法：模型 + ML</h3><p>2026 年的主流实践不是用 ML 完全替代传统模型，而是混合使用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>传统模型提供骨架</strong>：BSM/Heston 给出基准价格和 Greeks</li>\n<li><strong>ML 提供修正</strong>：神经网络学习模型残差（实际市场价格 - 模型价格）</li>\n<li><strong>ML 加速计算</strong>：用 NN 替代 MC 引擎加速定价和校准</li>\n<li><strong>ML 优化对冲</strong>：在传统 Greeks 基础上学习交易成本感知的调整</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种「model + residual」方法既保留了传统模型的可解释性和物理一致性，又利用 ML 捕捉了模型无法表达的市场微观结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生产环境部署考量\">生产环境部署考量</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考量维度</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms 推理</td>\n<td>模型量化、ONNX Runtime</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>不能突然输出异常值</td>\n<td>输出裁剪、异常检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可审计</td>\n<td>监管要求可解释</td>\n<td>基准模型回退、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新</td>\n<td>市场变化需重训</td>\n<td>在线学习、增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回测</td>\n<td>新模型上线前验证</td>\n<td>shadow mode 并行运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结-ml-时代的定价范式\">总结：ML 时代的定价范式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>传统方法</th>\n<th>ML 增强</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>理论基础</td>\n<td>无套利 + 风险中性</td>\n<td>保持不变——ML 是工具不是理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型选择</td>\n<td>Heston/LMM/SLV</td>\n<td>同上 + NN surrogate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值计算</td>\n<td>MC/FDM/Tree</td>\n<td>NN inference + PINN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校准</td>\n<td>迭代优化</td>\n<td>逆映射 NN（毫秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对冲</td>\n<td>BSM Greeks</td>\n<td>Deep Hedging（摩擦感知）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控</td>\n<td>场景分析 + VaR</td>\n<td>同上 + 实时全组合重定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ML 不会取代无套利定价的理论框架，但正在深刻改变这一框架的实现方式——从离线批处理走向实时智能化，从假设驱动走向数据增强，从单一模型走向集成系统。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>机器学习正在深刻改变衍生品定价的实现方式，但并未取代其理论基础。无套利定价的数学框架依然是定价的根基，ML 的角色是让这一框架的实现更快（NN 替代 MC）、更准（学习模型残差）、更实用（交易成本感知对冲）。PINN 通过将 PDE 嵌入损失函数实现了物理一致性与数据效率的统一；Deep Hedging 通过直接优化风险度量突破了 BSM 对冲的理想化假设；逆映射校准将复杂模型的校准时间压缩到毫秒级。2026 年的主流范式是「传统模型 + ML 增强」的混合方法——既保留可解释性和物理一致性，又利用 ML 捕捉市场微观结构。生产部署中的不确定性量化、外推检测和无套利约束是确保 ML 定价系统安全可靠的关键技术保障。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"exotic-options\">奇异期权定价方法与实践</a> | <a href=\"rates-credit-derivatives\">利率衍生品与信用衍生品定价</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"机器学习在衍生品定价中的应用","id":"机器学习在衍生品定价中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ML 在衍生品定价中的应用图景","id":"ml-在衍生品定价中的应用图景"},{"level":2,"text":"神经网络作为定价函数逼近器","id":"神经网络作为定价函数逼近器"},{"level":3,"text":"基本思路","id":"基本思路"},{"level":3,"text":"训练数据生成","id":"训练数据生成"},{"level":3,"text":"网络架构选择","id":"网络架构选择"},{"level":3,"text":"实验结果","id":"实验结果"},{"level":2,"text":"Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINN)","id":"physics-informed-neural-networks-pinn"},{"level":3,"text":"核心创新","id":"核心创新"},{"level":3,"text":"优势","id":"优势"},{"level":3,"text":"2025-2026 最新进展","id":"2025-2026-最新进展"},{"level":2,"text":"深度对冲（Deep Hedging）","id":"深度对冲-deep-hedging"},{"level":3,"text":"传统对冲的局限","id":"传统对冲的局限"},{"level":3,"text":"Deep Hedging 框架","id":"deep-hedging-框架"},{"level":3,"text":"强化学习在对冲中的应用","id":"强化学习在对冲中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"波动率曲面的 ML 建模","id":"波动率曲面的-ml-建模"},{"level":3,"text":"隐含波动率曲面预测","id":"隐含波动率曲面预测"},{"level":3,"text":"无套利约束的 ML 曲面","id":"无套利约束的-ml-曲面"},{"level":2,"text":"模型校准的 ML 加速","id":"模型校准的-ml-加速"},{"level":3,"text":"传统校准的痛点","id":"传统校准的痛点"},{"level":3,"text":"ML 加速方案","id":"ml-加速方案"},{"level":2,"text":"实践中的挑战与注意事项","id":"实践中的挑战与注意事项"},{"level":3,"text":"模型风险与可解释性","id":"模型风险与可解释性"},{"level":3,"text":"混合方法：模型 + ML","id":"混合方法-模型-ml"},{"level":3,"text":"生产环境部署考量","id":"生产环境部署考量"},{"level":2,"text":"总结：ML 时代的定价范式","id":"总结-ml-时代的定价范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"利率衍生品与信用衍生品定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/advanced/rates-credit-derivatives"},"next":null}